# 与其它仓库保持一致：入库统一 LF，避免 Windows/Linux 混用导致的整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# ── 例外：Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF ──
# `gradlew.bat` 里用了 goto/label，LF-only 在部分 cmd.exe 版本上会报
# "The syntax of the command is incorrect"，导致 Windows 上完全构建不了。
*.bat text eol=crlf

# ── 二进制：禁止任何转换与文本 diff ──
*.jar binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.apk binary
*.zip binary
